[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://src/Economy/ShopResource.cs" id="1_shop"]
[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://src/Economy/ShopStockEntry.cs" id="2_entry"]

; Marta Quill, the Emberdeep quartermaster (Phase 38N1) - the SINK the factor next door is the source
; for, and the other half of what makes a second settlement visible.
;
; SellFraction 0.62 is the most generous in the realm (the Embermarket runs 0.35-0.45), and `food` is
; her specialty on top of that. A mine grows nothing: every loaf, sack of grain and block of salt down
; here came up the road, so she pays over the odds for all of it and the player who walks food east is
; running the profitable leg of 38N's route.
;
; She sells almost nothing, and what she does sell is dear (BuyMarkup 1.7): a company store is not
; competing with anyone. The field rations are for the miners, priced as such.
;
; ⚠️ Her AcceptedTags are food, fuel and textile - NOT ore. The temptation was to let her buy
; everything so the walk is never wasted, and that is exactly the decision that would flatten the two
; settlements back into one. A production settlement has to refuse things.
;
; PurseGold 260 is the largest outside the town square, because a company that pays its people needs
; coin on hand - and because a sink with no money is a sink the player can empty on one trip.
;
; 38S: the stingiest haggle in the realm, 30 for -3, and the only one worth trying for the SELL side.
; Her 0.62 fraction is the realm's best and a struck deal pushes it to 0.68, or 0.85 on the food she
; specialises in (the clamp in SellPrice is what keeps even that under an item's own value) -
; which is the profitable leg of 38N's route paying better for one day, on a merchant who says no seven
; times in ten. ⚠️ A company store is the right place for the worst odds: she is not competing with
; anyone (see BuyMarkup 1.7 above), so there is nothing forcing her to deal.

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Stock_ration"]
script = ExtResource("2_entry")
ItemId = "item.food.field_ration"
Quantity = 12

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Stock_pick"]
script = ExtResource("2_entry")
